{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":44.369998931884766,"text":"On the hill above the modern town stand the Temple of Apollo, a small marble Odeon, and a stadium of about 200 meters. But the most important thing here is not a building, it is the plan. Ancient Rhodes was founded in 408 BC by the union of three older cities, and it did not sprawl the way most cities do. It was designed first, with streets crossing at right angles, in the way taught by Hippodomus of Miletus. Ancient writers described it as the most beautiful city they had seen, and the striking part is that the plan is still there. A good many streets in modern Rhodes follow the same lines, two and a half thousand years later.","words":[{"word":"On","start":0,"end":0.5600000023841858},{"word":"the","start":0.5600000023841858,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"hill","start":0.9599999785423279,"end":1.0199999809265137},{"word":"above","start":1.0199999809265137,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"the","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.5399999618530273},{"word":"modern","start":1.5399999618530273,"end":1.899999976158142},{"word":"town","start":1.899999976158142,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"stand","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"the","start":2.880000114440918,"end":3.440000057220459},{"word":"Temple","start":3.440000057220459,"end":3.440000057220459},{"word":"of","start":3.440000057220459,"end":3.700000047683716},{"word":"Apollo","start":3.700000047683716,"end":3.9800000190734863},{"word":"a","start":4.539999961853027,"end":4.699999809265137},{"word":"small","start":4.699999809265137,"end":5.099999904632568},{"word":"marble","start":5.099999904632568,"end":5.460000038146973},{"word":"Odeon","start":5.460000038146973,"end":5.900000095367432},{"word":"and","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.460000038146973},{"word":"a","start":6.460000038146973,"end":7.039999961853027},{"word":"stadium","start":7.039999961853027,"end":7.039999961853027},{"word":"of","start":7.0